   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Mountains & Buffalo** (1 other source): Opens the second set, followed by Spinal Meningitis [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Friends**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Lullaby**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Mountains & Buffalo**: back after 186 archived shows (2268 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Loving U Thru it All**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Little Birdy**: back after 68 archived shows (778 days) [3]\n- **Don't Laugh (I Love You)**: back after 90 archived shows (1127 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gween2009-05-09.mbho.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 84 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The show is split into two sets, with the first set closing on Happy Colored Marbles [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gween2009-05-09.mbho.flac16**: taped by Eric Foelske; source: MBHO 603a/actives/KA200 > V3 > HD-P2 [1]. Also: The transfer is labeled as a 16-bit FLAC with the tag 'mbho' in its filename [1]",
